[en.FOCUS_C12_NEW_TOY_FACTORY]
New Toy Factories

[en.FOCUS_C12_NEW_TOY_FACTORY_desc]
After the Last Roundup, Cheese Sandwich’s Joyful Enterprises provided shelter to countless desperate ponies. Now, Cheese Sandwich has convinced his board of directors to establish a large-scale Joyful Enterprises industrial park on our land, offering numerous job opportunities and civilian products, ensuring support for our future plans.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_NEW_TOY_FACTORY]
新的欢乐工厂园区

[zh.FOCUS_C12_NEW_TOY_FACTORY_desc]
终末之战后，芝士三明治的欢乐工厂庇护了无数走投无路的小马，如今，芝士三明治说服了他的董事会，将一座大型的欢乐工厂工业园区落座于我们的土地上，提供许多就业岗位和民用产品，并将为我们的未来计划提供保障。

